{"vid":"E7HKsnh7Ris","source":"E7HKsnh7Ris.en-en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.9,"txt":"You're learning with nine to five English business English for the workplace"},{"t":14.8,"txt":"Hi, Tim here with another 9 to 5 English lesson in"},{"t":21,"txt":"Today's lesson we're going to learn how [to] agree with ideas"},{"t":27.8,"txt":"Every day in life and work. We have to decide whether we agree or"},{"t":34.8,"txt":"disagree with other people's ideas"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"it might be in a serious discussion about who to hire or"},{"t":43.6,"txt":"how to cut costs or in a simple conversation about where to go for lunch and"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"when you hear an idea that you like"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"You want to show your support for it, right?"},{"t":60,"txt":"so you say something to agree with the idea to give it your support and"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"One good way to do that is to use that word"},{"t":72.4,"txt":"support, I mean"},{"t":74.4,"txt":"You can say something like I can support that"},{"t":78.9,"txt":"There are other ways to say the same thing"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"for example"},{"t":84.5,"txt":"you can say something makes a lot of sense which means it is [a] good idea or"},{"t":93.2,"txt":"you could say that [an] idea could work and"},{"t":98.2,"txt":"By saying something makes sense or could work"},{"t":102.8,"txt":"You're not just saying you agree"},{"t":105.9,"txt":"But that you agree because it's a good idea"},{"t":110.9,"txt":"How about practicing these expressions for [agreeing]?"},{"t":116,"txt":"We're going to present [some] examples"},{"t":119.1,"txt":"after each example try repeating it yourself"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"Ready let's get started"},{"t":127.3,"txt":"Yes, I think that could work"},{"t":133.9,"txt":"I can support that"},{"t":140.2,"txt":"You've brought up a really important point there"},{"t":148.6,"txt":"That makes a lot of sense to me, too"},{"t":156.6,"txt":"So we've [just] practiced some simple ways of showing that you agree with an idea"},{"t":164,"txt":"But what if you think an idea is more than just good I mean"},{"t":169.6,"txt":"what if you think it's a"},{"t":171.9,"txt":"fantastic idea"},{"t":174.3,"txt":"Well in that case"},{"t":176.3,"txt":"You want to agree strongly with the idea and show that you really love it in"},{"t":184.2,"txt":"English we've got some great expressions for this situation"},{"t":189.5,"txt":"for example"},{"t":190.8,"txt":"You can say I couldn't have said it better myself"},{"t":195.5,"txt":"Which means the person explained it perfectly?"},{"t":201.2,"txt":"Similarly you can say I couldn't agree with you more"},{"t":206,"txt":"Which means you totally agree?"},{"t":210.5,"txt":"These expressions beginning with AI are used to show you strongly agree"},{"t":217.8,"txt":"But you can start with that"},{"t":220.7,"txt":"meaning the idea and say how great it is for"},{"t":225.2,"txt":"[example], you could say that's brilliant"},{"t":229.9,"txt":"or"},{"t":231.1,"txt":"That's the best idea I've heard all day"},{"t":235.6,"txt":"Let's practice these expressions"},{"t":238.1,"txt":"for agreeing"},{"t":239.8,"txt":"strongly with ideas"},{"t":242.1,"txt":"Remember to repeat each example after you hear it I?"},{"t":248.2,"txt":"Couldn't have said it better myself"},{"t":255.4,"txt":"I couldn't agree with you more"},{"t":263.9,"txt":"That's Brilliant"},{"t":270.6,"txt":"That's the best idea I've heard all day"},{"t":279.3,"txt":"Now we've been focusing on how to show you agree with an idea but sometimes"},{"t":287,"txt":"You hear an idea and you're not [sure] if you agree"},{"t":291.5,"txt":"I mean, you don't really think it's a good or a bad idea in"},{"t":298.8,"txt":"This situation you can say that you feel neutral about it"},{"t":305.7,"txt":"So how can you express [that] feeling?"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"Well for one you can say that you are not exactly sure about it"},{"t":316.9,"txt":"That tells people that you might agree or you might disagree, but you don't know yet"},{"t":325.1,"txt":"Another way to express that you are neutral about an idea is"},{"t":330.4,"txt":"To say you could go either way, or that there are?"},{"t":335.8,"txt":"Pros and [cons] to both options"},{"t":339.6,"txt":"These are useful expressions when you're not sure what you think"},{"t":344.8,"txt":"or when you don't want to support one side or the other too quickly and"},{"t":352.3,"txt":"if you really think that two sides of an idea or two choices are"},{"t":359.1,"txt":"perfectly equal"},{"t":360.8,"txt":"you can say it's a"},{"t":363.7,"txt":"toss-Up"},{"t":365,"txt":"This expression comes from tossing [a] coin"},{"t":368.7,"txt":"Which is a way of choosing between two sides"},{"t":373.6,"txt":"Now it's your turn to practice using these expressions"},{"t":378.7,"txt":"once again"},{"t":380,"txt":"You can repeat the example"},{"t":382.4,"txt":"[after] you hear them"},{"t":385.1,"txt":"Well, I'm not exactly sure about that yet"},{"t":393.5,"txt":"I could go either way on this"},{"t":402.1,"txt":"I think there are pros and cons to both options"},{"t":411.8,"txt":"To me, it's a toss-up"},{"t":418.3,"txt":"so we've worked through some great expressions for agreeing and"},{"t":424.2,"txt":"Showing [that] you feel neutral about an idea, but how does this sound in conversation?"},{"t":431.8,"txt":"Let's listen to a short dialogue between two [co-workers]"},{"t":436.6,"txt":"John and Lucas"},{"t":439.1,"txt":"John is discussing some ideas for the business and"},{"t":443.5,"txt":"Lucas agrees with him"},{"t":446.9,"txt":"So I think we need to focus on new customers"},{"t":451.3,"txt":"yes, that makes a lot of sense to me too and"},{"t":454.8,"txt":"Maybe we need a fresh ad campaign I"},{"t":458.2,"txt":"Couldn't agree with you more"},{"t":461.6,"txt":"Can you hear how lucas showed his agreement with John's ideas?"},{"t":466.9,"txt":"He said that the idea of focusing on new customers makes a lot of sense"},{"t":474,"txt":"That expression shows basic agreement"},{"t":478.2,"txt":"Then he agreed"},{"t":480.3,"txt":"Strongly with the idea of a fresh ad campaign saying he couldn't agree more"},{"t":488.4,"txt":"Now it's your turn to practice"},{"t":492,"txt":"Will repeat the dialogue, but this time we're going to beep out the second speaker's words"},{"t":499.2,"txt":"You will have to say those parts yourself"},{"t":503.5,"txt":"Remember to start by saying that the first idea makes a lot of sense"},{"t":510.7,"txt":"Then you'll say [that] you couldn't agree more"},{"t":515.1,"txt":"Here we go"},{"t":517.6,"txt":"So I think we need [to] focus on new customers"},{"t":526.9,"txt":"and maybe we need a fresh ad campaign"},{"t":537.7,"txt":"all right, so we've learned some great ways to agree with other people's ideas and"},{"t":546.4,"txt":"We've looked at how to show you are neutral about an idea"},{"t":552.1,"txt":"In our next lesson we'll look at how to disagree with an idea"},{"t":558.9,"txt":"until then so long and"},{"t":562,"txt":"Happy Learning"}],"words":[{"t":2.86,"w":"You're"},{"t":2.86,"w":"learning"},{"t":2.86,"w":"with"},{"t":2.86,"w":"nine"},{"t":2.86,"w":"to"},{"t":2.86,"w":"five"},{"t":2.86,"w":"English"},{"t":2.86,"w":"business"},{"t":2.86,"w":"English"},{"t":2.86,"w":"for"},{"t":2.86,"w":"the"},{"t":2.86,"w":"workplace"},{"t":14.769,"w":"Hi,"},{"t":14.769,"w":"Tim"},{"t":14.769,"w":"here"},{"t":14.769,"w":"with"},{"t":14.769,"w":"another"},{"t":14.769,"w":"9"},{"t":14.769,"w":"to"},{"t":14.769,"w":"5"},{"t":14.769,"w":"English"},{"t":14.769,"w":"lesson"},{"t":14.769,"w":"in"},{"t":21.01,"w":"Today's"},{"t":21.01,"w":"lesson"},{"t":21.01,"w":"we're"},{"t":21.01,"w":"going"},{"t":21.01,"w":"to"},{"t":21.01,"w":"learn"},{"t":21.01,"w":"how"},{"t":21.01,"w":"[to]"},{"t":21.01,"w":"agree"},{"t":21.01,"w":"with"},{"t":21.01,"w":"ideas"},{"t":27.82,"w":"Every"},{"t":27.82,"w":"day"},{"t":27.82,"w":"in"},{"t":27.82,"w":"life"},{"t":27.82,"w":"and"},{"t":27.82,"w":"work."},{"t":27.82,"w":"We"},{"t":27.82,"w":"have"},{"t":27.82,"w":"to"},{"t":2